pan></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2683em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>k</mi><mtext>adj</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{q}_k^{\\text{adj}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2683em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 位标注员的难度校正后质量分。需要注意的是，加权投票并不能替代仲裁，它只是把「谁的意见更值得听」从人工判断变成了可计算的规则——如果所有标注员的权重都低，加权的结果仍然不可信，此时正确的处置是升级仲裁而不是相信加权。</p>\n<p>三条回流路径的消费方各不相同，但共享同一个前提：判定必须带理由。没有理由，金标题的复核无从下手（不知道专家为什么推翻了原答案）、抽检员的校准只能看到对错而看不到方向、指南修订更无从谈起。因此专家的判定表单上，「结论」与「理由」是两个必填字段而不是一个。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>回流目标</th>\n<th>被更新的对象</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>需要的字段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>金标题</td>\n<td>答案的新版本 + 历史评分撤销</td>\n<td>专家结论与金标题答案不同</td>\n<td>理由、影响的质量分记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽检员</td>\n<td>质检员的一致性基准</td>\n<td>抽检结论与专家结论系统性不同</td>\n<td>方向（趋严/趋同）、样本量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多数决策略</td>\n<td>该任务类型的合并规则</td>\n<td>多数决结论被推翻的比例超阈值</td>\n<td>被推翻的批次与聚类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"治理-谁定义-对\">治理：谁定义「对」</h2><h3 id=\"判据的归属与裁量权边界\">判据的归属与裁量权边界</h3><p>仲裁体系最终会遇到一个无法用技术解决的问题：<strong>业务定义本身是可以被质疑的</strong>。一条商品与查询的相关性，从算法视角（用户点击了它）、产品视角（它符合搜索意图）、商业视角（它能带来转化）看可能不同。专家判定的依据必须明确是哪一个视角，否则仲裁就变成了把某个人的偏好合法化。</p>\n<p>可行的治理结构是把「判据」写成可执行的文字，并且让判据的修订有明确的负责人（通常是搜索产品负责人而不是数据运营）。专家的自由裁量权应当被限制在判据未覆盖的情形上，而且每次行使裁量权都应该被记录为「判据需要补充」的信号。这样仲裁体系就从「一群人在做判断」变成了「一套定义在被人使用、检验、修订」，这才是它能长期稳定的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>仲裁的价值排序是：最终标签（低）&lt; 校准上游（高）&lt; 沉淀规则（最高，唯一能让成本随时间下降）。</li>\n<li>升级仲裁的触发条件有三类：结构性无解、低置信、高影响批次。</li>\n<li>同一聚类反复被仲裁应触发指南修订，而不是继续逐条烧专家时间。</li>\n<li>专家自身需要交叉校准；专家产能用预约制与批次作业，避免碎片化打断。</li>\n<li>仲裁结论必须回流校准金标题、抽检员与多数决策略；质量加权投票可对抗系统性偏差的多数人。</li>\n<li>判据的修订权必须明确归属业务负责人，专家裁量权限于判据未覆盖的情形。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>质量链条到此闭合。下一章把前面所有环节的产出折算成产能与成本，见 <a href=\"../label-throughput-cost/annotation-throughput-monitor\">标注产能/进度看板</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分歧仲裁专家判定","id":"分歧仲裁专家判定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：仲裁不是更高等级的标注","id":"核心概念-仲裁不是更高等级的标注"},{"level":3,"text":"三件事的价值排序","id":"三件事的价值排序"},{"level":2,"text":"什么任务该进仲裁队列","id":"什么任务该进仲裁队列"},{"level":3,"text":"三类准入筛选依据","id":"三类准入筛选依据"},{"level":3,"text":"仲裁状态机","id":"仲裁状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"专家的产能与一致性问题","id":"专家的产能与一致性问题"},{"level":3,"text":"专家数量与交叉校准","id":"专家数量与交叉校准"},{"level":3,"text":"交叉校准时怎么判定谁对","id":"交叉校准时怎么判定谁对"},{"level":2,"text":"仲裁结论如何回流","id":"仲裁结论如何回流"},{"level":3,"text":"三条回流路径","id":"三条回流路径"},{"level":2,"text":"治理：谁定义「对」","id":"治理-谁定义-对"},{"level":3,"text":"判据的归属与裁量权边界","id":"判据的归属与裁量权边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多人独立标注与一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relevance-crowdsourcing-label/quality-arbitration/multi-labeler-agreement"},"next":{"title":"标注产能/进度看板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relevance-crowdsourcing-label/label-throughput-cost/annotation-throughput-monitor"}}